                Mike &amp; Key ARC &mdash; Fox Hunt Program
              </p>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#8ecae6;font-size:15px;">
                September Regional Mobile Hunt &mdash; West
                Snohomish County
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- EVENT DETAILS BANNER -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#2e7d32;padding:14px 32px;">
